[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-STD007
TITLE: Line-up and takeoff cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall read back line up and wait, step until the aircraft is aligned and stopped, refuse to treat that state as airborne, then read back a takeoff clearance that contained wind and step until the climb. North offset on runway 27 shall stay inside 5 feet during the roll. Acceptance is the two readbacks and the climb phase. The test file is apps/aircraft/tests/test_aircraft.py.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is the example test for line up and takeoff.
<<<
DAL: E
